  "title": "Mike&#39;s Homemade Pizza",
  "description": "With basic ingredients, it&#39;s easy to make homemade pizza dough and sauce. The recipe makes two 12-inch cheese pizzas and lets you pick the toppings!",
  "authors": [
    "MJUCHT"
  ],
